  "bio": "Ramin Banan is a highly skilled tattoo artist operating out of Wiesbaden, Germany, known for his versatility in traditional, neotraditional, and dotwork styles, along with a specialty in vegan tattooing. Since embarking on his tattoo journey in 2009, Ramin has dedicated himself to mastering his craft, garnering a reputation for his meticulous approach and exceptional artistry at WildOneTattoo. His commitment is evident in every intricately inked piece that reflects both his deep passion for the art and his clients' visions.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Wiesbaden, Hesse, Germany\n\ntattooing since 2009⚡️ || WildOneTattoo 🤘🏼 || vegan tattooing 🌿\n.\n#raminwild \n.\ncats🐱 books🤓 movies🤩",
